    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystal Heroes is a new way to play a RPG using Match 3 for game mechanics. Battle on fantasy battlefields using RPG elements, level your characters, get new skills, new companions, pets, equipment, even use potions and scrolls to aid you in battle. Play against other players\u2019 teams in the Arena or raid castles and build defenses for your own castle. Fight against bandits, packs of wolves, undead and if you dare go up against dragons and other mythical creatures.</p>",
